This module is the ArkTS/NAPI bridge to a vendored MPV build. The bridge
source is part of the work covered by GPL-3.0-or-later. The binary artifacts
it ships are not our code and stay under their own licenses:

  - MPV               GPL-2.0+ / LGPL-2.1+ (per upstream terms)
  - FFmpeg (static)   LGPL-2.1+ / GPL-2.0+ depending on build flags
  - dav1d             BSD-2-Clause
  - mbedTLS           Apache-2.0
  - libxml2           MIT

See LICENSES/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md at the repository root for versions,
source URLs, and the static-linking analysis.

